  "decision": "No production rewrite: routing proxy construction-inclusive saving too small; current small-model admission/tile samples do not justify a large validation or persistent-packing implementation. No solver speedup claimed.",
  "qualification": [
    "Routing proxy removes numerical work/inlining context and is not a solver-time/removable bound. Ordered action checksum/count matches independently enumerated Python input for every shape. Five alternating pairs, not a qualifying timing screen.",
    "Packing census optimistic: geometry only, includes potentially ineligible calls; records are four-value packs, not scalar elements, bytes or cost. Cross-batch reuse scoped to a single parent-child apply, never across parents or Newton factors.",
    "Profiles are whole-batch self fractions including Python launcher/parsing/startup; tails per short process reduce represented events. Neither is near-complete attribution. No nested/additive removable-cost claim.",
    "Initial parser-only no-inherit recording and throttled period2M instruction recording retained and excluded. Healthy recordings have zero lost/throttle events.",
    "All complete results/exits agree within every batch and against other final batches after removing diagnostics.seconds only. Runtime source and accepted CLI unchanged. Full parity987/987 passes (136.1s under concurrent release-test compilation); no solver benchmark or speedup claim for this measurement-only commit."
